Package: majoris-characters
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Native character utility foundation for Majoris
 Provides the initial GTK application window, desktop entry, application
 actions, and persistent window settings for the Characters utility.
 Character browsing is planned for a subsequent development release.
